From 77839393be603f73086cc4d52b6fa8c2666429f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 08:20:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - plan the whole walk round every camp (A* over
 the known spawns)

plan_route(): a 5 yd grid over the corridor between us and the target (cell grows past 60k cells),
every hostile spawn we know (DB spawns + patrol nodes) painted by aggro reach + wander radius -
hard for mobs 2+ levels up and any pair/pack (a non-grey neighbour within 18 yd), soft for a lone
mob near our level (the road engage takes those). A* + string-pulling gives the turn points; a
clean plan replaces the route guard's refusal and the first-camp-only detour loop (35 of 139
multi-mob ambushes were on detours: going round one camp led into the next). No clean line ->
route guard + old detour as before. AW_NO_PLAN=1 turns it off.
Offline: staggered pairs -> round both (25 yd clear); open road -> no turns; wall -> not clean;
1000 yd through 40 pairs -> 7 turns, never within 23 yd; each plan < 0.05 s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
